From 519b0181a87c8e5e24e80e9455606b935a853223 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpaluri <mpaluri@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:11:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] prplmesh: Support for Service prioritization commands

Add controller-side BSP/ESP/QSP state handling and QCA vendor
TLV definitions for the service prioritization requests.

Parse 1905 BSP, ESP and QSP service prioritization requests on
the agent, and program the rules through the SAL lib to SPM.

Change-Id: I29267b7a36c4d5895834a877cd59f61ce6cfddca
Signed-off-by: Hariharan Karuppiah <harihk@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Anurag Sethi <anurseth@qti.qualcomm.com>

